Parfait ! Maintenant j'ai assez d'informations. Créons un rapport détaillé:

## Rapport Détaillé: Système d'Organisations Moodday

Voici une exploration en profondeur du système d'organisations dans le projet Moodday:

---

### 1. IMPLÉMENTATION DES ORGANISATIONS

#### Schéma Prisma
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/prisma/schema/better-auth.prisma`

Le système d'organisations repose sur **5 modèles clés** gérés par Better Auth:

```prisma
model Organization {
  id               String        @id
  name             String
  slug             String?       @unique
  logo             String?
  createdAt        DateTime
  metadata         String?
  stripeCustomerId String?
  members          Member[]
  invitations      Invitation[]
  subscription     Subscription?
  email            String?
}

model Member {
  id             String       @id
  organizationId String
  organization   Organization @relation(fields: [organizationId])
  userId         String
  user           User         @relation(fields: [userId])
  role           String       // "owner" | "admin" | "member"
  createdAt      DateTime
  updatedAt      DateTime     @default(now()) @updatedAt

  @@index([userId, organizationId])
}

model Invitation {
  id             String       @id
  organizationId String
  organization   Organization @relation(fields: [organizationId])
  email          String
  role           String?      // Role à attribuer
  status         String       // "pending" | "accepted" | "canceled"
  expiresAt      DateTime
  inviterId      String
  user           User         @relation(fields: [inviterId])
  createdAt      DateTime

  @@index([organizationId])
  @@index([email])
}

model Subscription {
  id                   String       @id
  plan                 String       // Plan tarifaire
  referenceId          String       @unique // = organizationId
  organization         Organization @relation(fields: [referenceId])
  stripeCustomerId     String?
  stripeSubscriptionId String?
  status               String?      // Statut Stripe
  periodStart          DateTime?
  periodEnd            DateTime?
  cancelAtPeriodEnd    Boolean?
  seats                Int?         // Nombre de sièges
  overrideLimits       Json?        // Limites personnalisées
}
```

**Points clés:**
- Chaque organisation a un **slug unique** utilisé dans les URLs
- Stockage du **Stripe Customer ID** pour la facturation
- Relation **many-to-many** entre User et Organization via Member
- Gestion des **invitations** avec statut et expiration

---

### 2. RÔLES ET PERMISSIONS

#### Définition des Rôles
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/src/lib/auth/auth-permissions.ts`

Trois rôles sont définis avec un système d'accès basé sur les permissions:

```typescript
// Permissions disponibles par action
const statement = {
  ...defaultStatements,     // Hérité de Better Auth
  project: ["create", "share", "update", "delete"],
  subscription: ["manage"],
  users: ["create", "delete"],
} as const;

// Rôle MEMBER - accès de base
const member = ac.newRole({
  project: ["create"],
  users: ["create"],
  ...memberAc.statements,  // Permissions de base Better Auth
});

// Rôle ADMIN - accès étendu
const admin = ac.newRole({
  project: ["create", "update"],
  subscription: ["manage"],
  users: ["create", "delete"],
  ...adminAc.statements,
});

// Rôle OWNER - accès complet
const owner = ac.newRole({
  ...(statement as Statements),  // Toutes les permissions
  ...ownerAc.statements,
});

export type AuthRole = "member" | "admin" | "owner";
```

#### Vérification des Rôles
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/src/lib/organizations/is-in-roles.ts`

```typescript
export const isInRoles = (userRoles?: AuthRole[], rolesNeeded?: AuthRole[]) => {
  if (!userRoles) return false;

  // Owner peut accéder à tout
  if (userRoles.includes("owner")) return true;

  // Vérification des rôles requis
  if (!rolesNeeded) return true;
  return rolesNeeded.every((role) => userRoles.includes(role));
};
```

**Caractéristiques:**
- Les **owners** ont accès à tout
- Les **admins** peuvent gérer les abonnements et les utilisateurs
- Les **members** peuvent créer des projets
- Permissions vérifiées via Better Auth API

---

### 3. RELATION UTILISATEURS-ORGANISATIONS

#### Récupération de l'Organisation Actuelle
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/src/lib/organizations/get-org.ts`

La logique centrale de récupération d'org:

```typescript
export const getCurrentOrg = async (params?: OrgParams) => {
  // 1. Récupérer la session utilisateur
  const user = await getSession();
  if (!user) return null;

  // 2. Chercher l'org active dans la session
  const org = await getOrg(params);
  if (!org) return null;

  // 3. Récupérer les rôles de l'utilisateur dans cette org
  const memberRoles = org.members
    .filter((member) => member.userId === user.session.userId)
    .map((member) => member.role);

  // 4. Vérifier les rôles requis
  if (memberRoles.length === 0 || 
      !isInRoles(memberRoles as AuthRole[], params?.roles)) {
    return null;  // Accès refusé
  }

  // 5. Vérifier les permissions (si requises)
  if (params?.permissions) {
    const hasPermission = await auth.api.hasPermission({
      permission: params.permissions,
    });
    if (!hasPermission.success) return null;
  }

  // 6. Récupérer les données complètes
  const [currentSubscription, owner] = await Promise.all([
    getOrgActiveSubscription(org.id),
    findOrCreateOwner(org.id),
  ]);

  return {
    ...org,
    memberRoles: memberRoles as AuthRole[],
    subscription: currentSubscription,
    limits: currentSubscription?.limits ?? getPlanLimits(),
  };
};

// Version stricte qui lance une exception si pas d'accès
export const getRequiredCurrentOrg = async (params?: OrgParams) => {
  const result = await getCurrentOrg(params);
  if (!result) unauthorized();
  return result;
};
```

**Pattern d'utilisation en Server Components:**
```typescript
// Dans les layout/pages
const org = await getRequiredCurrentOrgCache();

// Pour les routes API avec autorisation
export const orgRoute = route
  .defineMetadata(z.object({
    roles: z.array(z.enum(RolesKeys)).optional(),
    permissions: AuthPermissionSchema.optional(),
  }))
  .use(async ({ next, metadata }) => {
    const organization = await getCurrentOrg(metadata);
    if (!organization) throw new ZodRouteError("Access denied", 401);
    return next({ ctx: { organization } });
  });
```

---

### 4. SYSTÈME D'INVITATION

#### Invitation des Membres
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/app/orgs/[orgSlug]/(navigation)/settings/members/org-invite-member-form.tsx`

Formulaire d'invitation client:

```typescript
const Schema = z.object({
  email: z.string().email(),
  role: z.string().default("member"),
});

export const OrganizationInviteMemberForm = () => {
  const { data: activeOrg } = authClient.useActiveOrganization();
  const router = useRouter();

  const mutation = useMutation({
    mutationFn: async (values) => {
      // Utilise Better Auth client pour envoyer l'invitation
      const result = await authClient.organization.inviteMember({
        email: values.email,
        role: values.role as AuthRole,
      });
      if (result.error) {
        toast.error(result.error.message);
        return;
      }
      toast.success("Invitation sent");
      router.refresh();
    },
  });

  return (
    <Dialog>
      <Form form={useForm({
        schema: Schema,
        onSubmit: (values) => mutation.mutateAsync(values),
      })}>
        {/* Champs email et role */}
      </Form>
    </Dialog>
  );
};
```

#### Gestion des Invitations
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/app/orgs/[orgSlug]/(navigation)/settings/members/org-members-form.tsx`

Affichage avec actions:

```typescript
{invitations.map((invitation) => {
  const isExpired = new Date(invitation.expiresAt) < new Date();

  return (
    <div key={invitation.id}>
      <Typography>{invitation.email}</Typography>
      <Badge>{isExpired ? "Expired" : invitation.status}</Badge>

      {/* Bouton d'annulation */}
      <Button onClick={() => {
        authClient.organization.cancelInvitation({
          invitationId: invitation.id,
        });
      }}>
        Cancel
      </Button>
    </div>
  );
})}
```

#### Acceptation des Invitations
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/app/orgs/accept-invitation/[id]/page.tsx`

Page de confirmation:

```typescript
export default async function AcceptInvitationPage(
  props: PageProps<"/orgs/accept-invitation/[id]">
) {
  const params = await props.params;
  const user = await getUser();

  const invitation = await prisma.invitation.findUnique({
    where: { id: params.id },
    include: { organization: true },
  });

  if (!invitation) {
    return <Card><CardTitle>Invitation Not Found</CardTitle></Card>;
  }

  return (
    <Card>
      <CardTitle>Join {invitation.organization.name}</CardTitle>
      {user ? (
        <form>
          <Button formAction={async () => {
            "use server";
            await auth.api.acceptInvitation({
              body: { invitationId: params.id },
              headers: await headers(),
            });
            redirect(`/orgs/${invitation.organization.slug}`);
          }}>
            Accept Invitation
          </Button>
        </form>
      ) : (
        <SignInProviders callbackUrl={`/orgs/accept-invitation/${params.id}`} />
      )}
    </Card>
  );
}
```

---

### 5. GESTION DES MEMBRES

#### Mise à Jour des Rôles
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/app/orgs/[orgSlug]/(navigation)/settings/members/org-members-form.tsx`

```typescript
const updateRoleMutation = useMutation({
  mutationFn: async ({ memberId, role }: { memberId: string; role: AuthRole }) => {
    return unwrapSafePromise(
      authClient.organization.updateMemberRole({
        memberId,
        role,
      })
    );
  },
  onMutate: ({ memberId, role }) => {
    updateOptimisticMembers({ type: "UPDATE_ROLE", memberId, role });
  },
  onSuccess: () => {
    toast.success("Member role updated successfully");
    router.refresh();
  },
});

// Utilisation dans le composant
<Select
  disabled={isCurrentUser}
  defaultValue={member.role}
  onValueChange={(value) => {
    updateRoleMutation.mutate({
      memberId: member.id,
      role: value as AuthRole,
    });
  }}
>
  <SelectTrigger className="w-[120px]">
    <SelectValue placeholder="Select role" />
  </SelectTrigger>
  <SelectContent>
    {RolesKeys.map((role) => (
      <SelectItem key={role} value={role}>
        {role.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + role.slice(1)}
      </SelectItem>
    ))}
  </SelectContent>
</Select>
```

#### Suppression des Membres

```typescript
const removeMemberMutation = useMutation({
  mutationFn: async (memberId: string) => {
    await authClient.organization.removeMember({
      memberIdOrEmail: memberId,
      organizationId: org.id,
    });
  },
  onMutate: (memberId) => {
    updateOptimisticMembers({ type: "DELETE", memberId });
  },
  onSuccess: () => {
    toast.success("Member removed successfully");
    router.refresh();
  },
});

const handleRemoveMember = (memberId: string) => {
  dialogManager.confirm({
    title: "Remove member",
    description: "Are you sure you want to remove this member?",
    action: {
      label: "Remove",
      onClick: async () => {
        removeMemberMutation.mutate(memberId);
      },
    },
  });
};
```

---

### 6. SCOPING DES DONNÉES PAR ORGANISATION

#### Récupération des Membres
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/src/query/org/get-orgs-members.ts`

```typescript
export const getOrgsMembers = async (
  orgId: string,
  options: GetOrgsMembersOptions = {},
) => {
  const { page = 1, pageSize = 50 } = options;

  // Query scopée par organizationId
  return prisma.member.findMany({
    where: {
      organizationId: orgId,  // ← Clé du scoping
    },
    select: {
      id: true,
      role: true,
      userId: true,
      user: {
        select: {
          image: true,
          id: true,
          name: true,
          email: true,
        },
      },
    },
    skip: (page - 1) * pageSize,
    take: pageSize,
    orderBy: { createdAt: "desc" },
  });
};

export type OrgMembers = Prisma.PromiseReturnType<typeof getOrgsMembers>;
```

#### Utilisation en Page
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/app/orgs/[orgSlug]/(navigation)/settings/members/page.tsx`

```typescript
export default async function MembersPage() {
  const org = await getRequiredCurrentOrgCache();

  // Les données sont déjà scopées par l'organisation
  const members = await getOrgsMembers(org.id);
  const invitations = await prisma.invitation.findMany({
    where: { organizationId: org.id },
  });

  return <OrgMembersForm 
    members={members}
    maxMembers={org.limits.maxMembers}
    invitations={invitations}
  />;
}
```

#### Pattern de Scoping dans les Routes API
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/src/lib/zod-route.ts`

```typescript
/**
 * Route handler avec autorisation basée sur l'org
 */
export const orgRoute = route
  .defineMetadata(z.object({
    roles: z.array(z.enum(RolesKeys)).optional(),
    permissions: AuthPermissionSchema.optional(),
  }))
  .use(async ({ next, metadata }) => {
    const organization = await getCurrentOrg(metadata);

    if (!organization) {
      throw new ZodRouteError(
        "You need to be part of an organization to access this resource.",
        401
      );
    }

    return next({
      ctx: { organization },
    });
  });

// Utilisation:
export const POST = orgRoute
  .metadata({ permissions: { subscription: ["manage"] } })
  .handler(async (req, { ctx }) => {
    // ctx.organization contient l'org vérifiée
    // Toutes les données doivent être scopées par ctx.organization.id
    return { success: true };
  });
```

---

### 7. CRÉATION ET GESTION DES ORGANISATIONS

#### Création d'une Nouvelle Org
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/app/orgs/new/new-org-form.tsx`

```typescript
export const NewOrganizationForm = () => {
  const mutation = useMutation({
    mutationFn: async (values: NewOrganizationSchemaType) => {
      const result = await authClient.organization.create({
        name: values.name,
        slug: values.slug,
      });

      if (result.error) {
        toast.error(result.error.message);
        return;
      }

      toast.success("Organization created successfully");
      window.location.href = `/orgs/${result.data.slug}`;
    },
  });

  const form = useForm({
    schema: CreateOrgSchema,
    onSubmit: async (values) => {
      await mutation.mutateAsync(values);
    },
  });

  return (
    <Form form={form}>
      <form.AppField name="name">
        {/* Input du nom */}
      </form.AppField>

      <form.AppField 
        name="slug"
        asyncDebounceMs={300}
        validators={{
          onChangeAsync: async ({ value }) => {
            const { error } = await authClient.organization.checkSlug({
              slug: value,
            });
            if (error) return "This organization ID is already taken";
            return undefined;
          },
        }}
      >
        {/* Input du slug avec validation asynchrone */}
      </form.AppField>
    </Form>
  );
};
```

#### Setup Automatique à l'Inscription
**Fichier**: `/Users/yoannandrieux/Projets/moodday/src/lib/auth.ts`

```typescript
export const auth = betterAuth({
  // ...
  databaseHooks: {
    user: {
